    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c5761bd594e02400b9efff1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。\r\n“大王”已投身于这片漩涡，\r\n而“特异点”的波澜也已抵达……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e4b744606199f1a8095218faf6a6b9e798d1a76cae84951e4472371bb94d6b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
