    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22fb361b6a706e84574ee4cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所谓“泪滴方舟”，\r\n便是能与那二者对抗的存在。\r\n但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "25f792b7391e60cdfe503207d659ebb2edcf218ff00d78f9cbeb86512dacdfe4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
