    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03946ac57691c1925395fc95",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这方舟究竟要如何对抗那二人……\r\n这方舟要驶往何方……\r\n作为“船长”，新宇宙还需磨练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5a22e24d253c9056d4295dc36068f4ba0b90e048b4757d41ee204e0983509f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105209.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dac8a16d3d9fc143c31fd8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105209.json",
      "json_path": [
