    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3204c575027a71a2421efc2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『想要与你一同斩获胜利』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1bfa1326853577ea28bd293120152f0f4d4465a8655e8db38b3eecb74dedb36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105209.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6658f378c8e94ba4133c229",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105209.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9be6428e2ea90a38e5e8d28d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "存在着在那一日，\r\n一度因那断崖而失去的『连接』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f7407504b77a7b524c349f36da2f38ce3d84c4d791520dac4a9d0efae587d92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105209.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5048a6399d1c1389c37b46f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——我无法确认这究竟是两耳真切听见的声音，\r\n抑或是新宇宙心声在我脑海中的回响。\r\n但是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5ac14841b8833ab7e77d68a75274cace424d74943b5e773fdad00c0bbe51149",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105209.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0602abe9d6a116a6e1a8ed46",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我可以确定一件事情。\r\n新宇宙的意志，绝对无法动摇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91d65d05a3ad2d6e57417d4f67577ac03d18e797f3d7666b26f5ecd11a5b9ffd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105209.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:599f184e74a277d2816a4054",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这就是一场旅途的终点站。\r\n这就是……『日本杯』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24eda68af3b707d6f4752f369541f4ea7f372918beb5a49442d3a970c895436e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105209.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5ee76c424f83859fdd8b20a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "上吧，新宇宙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a82dfb1c3a718407244903c6aaf6cb73f5d4d1770381a9bebf4d6be11109942",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105209.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa4799e1acfb61ec64f11cdf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在此之后，我们将会踏上怎样的旅途，\r\n我们将会怎样前进？我们又会遇上怎样的人？\r\n此刻还不得而知。所以——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dd9af884282b18c813fecd6bbd12822e6982fcf6aab2b0693c2f5e5679f986e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105209.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9f239fbbc7f4134b7a283a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们一起，赢得胜利吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5ea3b4e7529a183cee8175d3499f27849d30a1db9e2108162cd1d744cecb6d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105209.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/choice_data_list/0"
    },
